OL,3,AWoman drugged and advertised for sex by
OL,4,Ahusband speaks out as abusers found
OL,5,Aguilty
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Thursday, Norman Macksoni, 48,
OL,8,FRichard Wilkins, 62, Connor
OL,9,FSanderson-Doyle, 32, and Mohammed
OL,10,FHassan, 38, were found guilty of
OL,11,Fmultiple sexual offences by a jury at
OL,12,FWinchester Crown Court. Wilkins and
OL,13,FMacksoni were each found guilty of one
OL,14,Fcount of rape.
